+// Auto ghost upload for Evolution Racing members.
+//
+// F-Zero GX saves a Time Attack ghost as a GameCube memory card file (8P-GFZE-fzg<16 hex>.dat.gci) in Dolphin's GCI
+// folder for slot A. This Dolphin notices new ones and, as the member chose (Auto / Ask / Off, default Ask), sends each
+// to the member's hub account (the hub link: a code the member made on the hub's Ghosts page). The hub checks the ghost
+// against the track and puts it on that track's Time Attack leaderboard. The other way round, evoracing://ghost/...
+// links on the hub's track pages put a leaderboard ghost into this Dolphin's memory card.
+//
+// Nothing here knows the hub's tracks: the Dolphin sends the ghost file, the sha1 of the disc's course file for the
+// ghost's course slot (stage/COLI_COURSE<slot>.lz, so the hub can tell which of its tracks it is), and its build id.
