+// lit17s41k FEATURE K: racer identities + nearby nameplates (see ERNameplates.h).
+//
+// RAM (F-Zero GX GFZE01, docs fzgx-custom docs/kb/machine-state-from-decomp.md + memory-map.md):
+//   B = *(0x800030C8) main.rel; racers *(B + 0x227878) stride 0x620, count u8 B + 0x22788A; racer +0x0 flags,
+//   +0x4 s16 index, +0x6 s16 machine, +0x3C machine name, +0x7C position, +0xEC basis (cols right / up / back),
+//   +0x474 s8 human port (-1 CPU), +0x484 AI block; camera *(B + 0x1BAFAC): +0x02 s16 target racer, +0xDC view Mtx34;
+//   mode s16 B + 0x1BA9A0 (2 = game), sub-mode s16 B + 0x1BA9A2 (live: 36 racing; the decomp's 40/41 - 5); demo B + 0x17D2FC;
+//   race difficulty block 0x803EF564: u8 class (0 Novice .. 3 Master), u8 course id.
+//   Natural v2 identity block (fzgx-custom-ainatural2 analysis/ainatural2/IDENTITY-ABI.md): "NID1" at B + 0x7D74C,
+//   +0x4 version 1, +0x5 slots, +0x6 stride, +0x8 seed, +0xC REL offset of ARC (u8 archetype per slot, 1..5, 0 none).
+//   Pilot name table: 45 char* at B + 0x18E8A8 (indexed by character id).
+// Everything here runs on the video thread: once a frame a few hundred bytes of RAM are read; strings are only touched
+// when a new race starts (the roster) and the atlas is rasterised then (stb_truetype, the build's Noto Sans Bold).
+
