+WeatherState s_wx;
+// lit17s14: weather quality (GFX.ini [PC5090] WeatherQuality = Ultra | Low, default Ultra), read once a frame. Each
+// weather action carries "quality": "low" (the lit17s13 shader, unchanged) or "ultra"; only the matching one draws.
+// With no Ultra action installed the Low one draws whatever the setting says.
