+// lit17s4: every machine body draw seen this frame (FillDrawUniforms: the damage / hull / surface body shaders cover
+// every machine texture, the "car" anchor group only some): at the frame end the ones no anchor noted are given to the
+// nearest racer, so multi-part machines whose parts are not anchor textures (Mighty Typhoon ...) still get their part ->
+// hit space transforms (without them those parts had no hull frame: hx_info.w = 0, no speed heat / damage there)
